  "contentHtml": "<p>1. <span>The 1991 Project’s oral history collection (l</span>ed by&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2Fshreyasnarla&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C8a46db646d834427208d08dee98b5a38%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639204981916914945%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=ng0WeHjoDLGJyTpaf1BOUZ1aCI%2FZnmfb%2FaZSjcYbIeY%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Shreyas Narla</a>&nbsp;and Shruti)&nbsp;with ~50 hours of interviews with policy reformers and witnesses to India’s market &nbsp;liberalization, is&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fthe1991project.com%2Foral-history&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C8a46db646d834427208d08dee98b5a38%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639204981916968346%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=BtPOYQTSkC0mWIO20K7Kn%2F%2Fif7p2MY8N2psZ4cu0mN4%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">now available</a>.</p>\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://www.cato.org/blog/friday-feature-mini-cities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Mini Cities</a>.</p>\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://claude.ai/share/275fbe33-bfd0-4a34-a927-6dc2e36d0522\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The new Claude, on Mondrian</a>.</p>\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://x.com/hosseeb/status/2080396229536800952?s=46&amp;t=fSypFxt84bBHId-do9r5Ag\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">More on cybersecurity and cyberdefense</a>.&nbsp; And <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jul/22/openai-cyberattack/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Simon Willison on The Incident</a>.&nbsp; And <a href=\"https://x.com/jon_stokes/status/2080729236013187369\" target=\"_blank\